  },
  {
    "role": "deduction",
    "text": "And $AE$ is the rectangle contained by $AB$ and $BC$. For it is contained by $AB$ and $BE$, and $BE$ (is) equal to $BC$.",
    "assertion": "AE is the rectangle contained by AB and BC",
